.
.  Create a GIF file for a mean plot
.
DEVICE 1 OFF
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
.
SKIP 25
READ DRAFT69B.DAT Y JUNK X
RETAIN Y X SUBSET X > 0
.
TITLE AUTOMATIC
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
X1LABEL Month
XLIMITS 1 12
XTIC OFFSET 0.5 0.5
MAJOR XTIC MARK NUMBER 12
MINOR XTIC MARK NUMBER 0
X1TIC MARK LABEL FORMAT ALPHA
X1TIC MARK LABEL CONTENT JAN FEB MARCH APRIL MAY JUNE JULY AUGUST ...
      SEPT OCT NOV DEC
Y1LABEL Mean Rank
LABEL SIZE 3
TIC LABEL SIZE 2.2
CHARACTER X BLANK
LINE BLANK SOLID
.
PRE-ERASE OFF
MEAN PLOT Y X
.
QUIT
